      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "If you are using a legacy operating system on your computer, you might need to update some components of your operating system to enable the DVD video playback function. The requirements for legacy operating systems are as follows:\nv Windows 95, Windows Server® 2000, Windows Server 2003: You must install the latest service pack, Internet Explorer® 5, and DirectX®. v Windows 98, Windows 98 Second Edition, Windows Millennium Edition: You must install the latest DirectX.",
